# Picket — how git treats file contents.

# Store every text file with LF endings, and check it out as LF on every OS.
# Without this, an edit on Windows (CRLF) and one in WSL (LF) make every line look changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert their bytes, never diff or merge them as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pkh binary